                shear_fracture_energy: Some((740.0, Unknown("ASSUMED dry-spruce analogue: the Wood row's value and source carried, no green-wood value read (clear Norway spruce RL mode II, Fruehmann et al. ICF10 2001). Settled by a green Norway spruce measurement of this quantity"))),
